Usage: /home/sunking/Documentos/antigravity/Open Nectar Android/build/bin/nectar-launcher [--rom FILE.iso] [--install-dir DIR] [--extract-only]
With no arguments it opens the graphical installer (needs zenity or kdialog);
from a terminal without those it falls back to the text installer.
The disc image must come from your own copy of Pikmin: USA Rev 1 or Europe.
--skip-verify skips the image integrity check.
--dolphin-tool PATH enables RVZ/WIA/GCZ conversion (also found beside the launcher or on PATH).
In game, F1 opens graphics, controls and gameplay settings.
